# Caps Lock holds Ctrl. Paste waits until its physical release.
0 in sock connect
0 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK down
0 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
100 in sock paste
400 in tick
500 in key KEY_CAPSLOCK up
500 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
500 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down
500 out key KEY_INSERT down
500 out key KEY_INSERT up
500 out key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up
500 out sock pasted
